c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 15px auto 10px; padding: 0px 0px 2px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.1; color: #333333; font-size: 24px; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: bold;\"\u003eGiá trị dinh dưỡng trong ngũ cốc Calbee Nhật Bản\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; color: #333333; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 11pt;\"\u003eTrong \u003cem style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"\u003engũ cốc Calbee 800g\u003c/em\u003e có chứa:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; color: #333333; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; text-align: justify;\"\u003eNăng lượng 223kcal, Vitamin A 150g, Protein 3,9g, Vitamin B1 0,34mg, Lipid 8,0g, Vitamin B6 0,34mg, Carbohydrates 31,6g, Vitamin B12 0,67mg, Chất xơ 4,5g, Niacin 3.7mg, Natri 94mg, Axit folic 67mg, Canxi 12mg, Pantothenic acid 1.9mg, Sắt 5,0mg, Vitamin D 1,67mg, Kali 133mg, Cholesterol 0mg, Phốt pho 82mg, Natri clorua tương đương 0,2g\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 15px auto 10px; padding: 0px 0px 2px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.1; color: #333333; font-size: 24px; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: bold;\"\u003eĐối tượng sử dụng ngũ cốc Calbee\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; color: #333333; font-family: Aria